{"status": "progress", "message": "Retrieved 112 candidate paragraphs; kept 3", "stage": "retrieve", "claim_index": 1, "data": {"kind": "retrieval", "pass": 1, "queries": ["Eiffel Tower", "Gustave Eiffel"], "candidates": 112, "by_source": {"web": 3, "wikipedia": 109}, "avgdl": 135.4, "top": [{"text": "An engineer by training, Eiffel founded and developed a company specializing in metal structural work, whose crowning achievement was the Eiffel Tower. He devot", "source": "web", "dense": 0.818, "bm25": 14.87, "dense_rank": 1, "bm25_rank": 1, "rrf": 0.03279, "selected": true}, {"text": "The Eiffel Tower (/ \u02c8a\u026af\u0259l / \u24d8 EYE-f\u0259l; French: Tour Eiffel [tu\u0281 \u025bf\u025bl] \u24d8) is a lattice tower on the Champ de Mars in Paris, France. It is named after the engine", "source": "web", "dense": 0.759, "bm25": 12.91, "dense_rank": 3, "bm25_rank": 4, "rrf": 0.0315, "selected": true}, {"text": "The Eiffel Tower (  EYE-f\u0259l; French: Tour Eiffel [tu\u0281 \u025bf\u025bl] ) is a lattice tower on the Champ de Mars in Paris, France. It is named after the engineer Gustave E", "source": "wikipedia", "dense": 0.726, "bm25": 12.93, "dense_rank": 5, "bm25_rank": 3, "rrf": 0.03126, "selected": true}, {"text": "Alexandre Gustave Eiffel (  EYE-f\u0259l; French: [al\u025bks\u0251\u0303d\u0281 \u0261ystav \u025bf\u025bl]; n\u00e9 Bonickhausen dit Eiffel; 15 December 1832 \u2013 27 December 1923) was a French civil engine", "source": "wikipedia", "dense": 0.741, "bm25": 12.88, "dense_rank": 4, "bm25_rank": 5, "rrf": 0.03101, "selected": false}, {"text": "Eiffel was selected because of his experience with wind stresses. Eiffel devised a structure consisting of a four legged pylon to support the copper sheeting wh", "source": "wikipedia", "dense": 0.708, "bm25": 11.14, "dense_rank": 6, "bm25_rank": 8, "rrf": 0.02986, "selected": false}, {"text": "He is best known for the Eiffel Tower, designed by his company and built for the 1889 Universal Exposition in Paris, and his contribution to building the Statue", "source": "web", "dense": 0.68, "bm25": 11.7, "dense_rank": 9, "bm25_rank": 7, "rrf": 0.02942, "selected": false}, {"text": "Gustave Eiffel University (French: Universit\u00e9 Gustave Eiffel) is a public university located throughout Metropolitan France. The university's namesake is French", "source": "wikipedia", "dense": 0.766, "bm25": 9.92, "dense_rank": 2, "bm25_rank": 16, "rrf": 0.02929, "selected": false}, {"text": "Eiffel initially showed little enthusiasm, but he did approve further study, and the two engineers then asked Stephen Sauvestre, the head of the company's archi", "source": "wikipedia", "dense": 0.675, "bm25": 10.27, "dense_rank": 10, "bm25_rank": 11, "rrf": 0.02837, "selected": false}], "selected": 3, "echo_filtered": 0, "kept": 3}, "t": 7.782}
